\begin {tikzcd} A(F(x), -) \ar [d, Rightarrow, "≀", "πₓ"'] & A(F(y), -) \ar [d, Rightarrow, "≀"', "π_y"]\ar [l, Rightarrow, "-∘\overline {F}(f)"'] \\ X(x, U(-)) & X(y, U(-)) \ar [l, Rightarrow, "-∘f"] \end {tikzcd}
it is indeed the case.

